    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d268">

                <pb facs="0370" n="272" xml:id="pg272"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48/2674: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gunther</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-27T12:00:00+00:19"><hi rendition="#italic">March 27,
                                1920—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 4:28 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>227. No need now to answer my 217 March 24.<anchor n="21" xml:id="d268-f1"/></p>
                <p>Alonzo Taylor and Germaine [<hi rendition="#italic">Goode?</hi>] have been here
                    and left last night for Copenhagen. Holland agrees to participate generously,
                    sum to be fixed next week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
